ENGINE_LOADED(3864,{"ws":3864,"brand":"Jingshi Energy","study":{"id":10645,"name":"JE cohort B competitors 90d","created":false,"window":"2026-07-17..2026-10-15","source":"PAGES","pairedBrandStudy":{"id":10644,"name":"JE cohort A brand voice 90d","posts":34}},"pillars":[{"id":"p1","name":"Blackout & bill anxiety","name_zh":"停电与电费焦虑","verdict":"contested","headline":"In the fear of losing comfort, we often overlook our greatest strength—community.","headline_zh":"在害怕失去舒适的时候，我们常常忽略了最大的力量——社区。","territory":"Outages, heat waves and rising bills that put food, comfort and business continuity at risk. Competitors posted 89 times here in 90 days (Ecoflow 52 posts, 16.1k engagements); Jingshi's 5 blackout-backup posts all ran in the first week of August.","territory_zh":"停电、热浪和不断上涨的电费，威胁着食物、舒适和生意的连续性。90 天内竞品在这里发了 89 篇（Ecoflow 52 篇，互动 1.61 万）；Jingshi 的 5 篇停电备电内容全部集中在 8 月第一周。","persona":{"themeId":79440,"title":"The Eco-Centric Tech Enthusiast","characterId":2861,"characterName":"Elena Greenwald","summary":"Blends technology, sustainability and well-being; invests in eco-friendly home improvements and seeks financial independence, driven by needs for security, comfort and autonomy.","created":false},"tension":{"themeId":79450,"type":"pain_points","title":"Navigating the Challenges of Power Instability and Energy Costs","summary":"Unstable power shows up as frequent outages, high energy bills and extreme-weather discomfort: anxiety during disruptions, spoiled food, heat waves and financial losses for businesses.","brandThemeId":79435,"brandThemeTitle":"Addressing Power Instability: A Call for Reliable Energy Solutions"},"angle":{"id":23687,"type":"psychological","title":"Fear of Loss","text":"Loss Aversion Theory: the fear of losing food, comfort and stability during outages weighs more than equivalent gains, which heightens sensitivity to power instability.","created":false},"story":{"id":3716,"title":"The Light We Lost","narrative":"Eco-tech advocate Elena Greenwald is sharing energy-efficiency tips at a town meeting when a storm cuts the power. Fear of spoiled food and lost comfort grips the room until she lights a battery lantern and turns the blackout into a shared moment. Weeks later her neighbours organise around community renewable-energy solutions, less ruled by the fear of loss.","created":false},"kpi":{"evidencePosts":94,"engagement":17838,"brandPosts":5,"brandEng":1},"sov":{"brandShare":14.7,"categoryShare":8.3,"brandPosts":5,"brandTotal":34,"catPosts":89,"catTotal":1070},"trend":{"months":["2026-07","2026-08","2026-09","2026-10"],"brand":[0,5,0,0],"category":[21,41,24,3]},"trendNote":"Monthly organic post counts from posts-aggregate on the tension cluster (competitors) plus the matched Jingshi cohort-A cluster (brand); July covers 17–31 and October 1–15 only (study window 2026-07-17..2026-10-15). Category volume peaked in August (41); Jingshi posted only in August.","examples":{"tofu":[{"postId":682720406,"src":"organic","net":"instagram","date":"2026-08-03","img":"e682720406","text":"Never panic during sudden grid blackouts again! 5kWh wall-hung lithium iron phosphate battery works with off-grid inverter to supply continuous backup power for essential home loads during storms, grid maintenance and power outages. Safe, stable and long-lasting for family emergency…","metrics":{"likes":1,"comments":0,"shares":null,"views":291},"score":null,"why":"Fear-of-loss hook on sudden blackouts with no call to action; the brand's most-viewed post in this territory (291 views, 1 like). No confident clickability score.","why_zh":"以“突然停电不再慌”的损失厌恶切入，没有行动号召；这是品牌在该话题下观看最多的一篇（291 次观看、1 个赞）。没有达到置信门槛的点击率预测。"},{"postId":682715313,"src":"organic","net":"facebook","date":"2026-08-03","img":"e682715313","text":"Never panic during sudden grid blackouts again! 5kWh wall-hung lithium iron phosphate battery works with off-grid inverter to supply continuous backup power for essential home loads during storms, grid maintenance and power outages. Safe, stable and long-lasting for family emergency…","metrics":{"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Same caption cross-posted to Facebook with a family-in-a-storm frame that mirrors the story's fear of losing comfort; no engagement recorded and no confident score.","why_zh":"同一文案同步发到 Facebook，画面是暴风雨夜的一家人，正对应故事里“害怕失去舒适”的情绪；没有记录到互动，也没有达到置信门槛的评分。"},{"postId":null,"src":"concept","net":null,"date":null,"img":"gen_xhs","text":"Concept render (SOMIN-generated, not published): a woman reads on a city apartment balcony at dusk, lamp on, beside a wall-mounted home battery.","metrics":{"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Fills the awareness slot with a calm \"the lights stay on\" scene for outage anxiety; a concept, so it has no metrics or score.","why_zh":"用“灯一直亮着”的安心场景补上认知阶段；这是概念图，没有数据，也没有评分。"}],"mofu":[{"postId":682720403,"src":"paid","net":"facebook","date":"2026-06-15","img":"ea682720403","text":"High Bills & Frequent Blackouts? Try Our Certified Storage Battery — Fed up with soaring electricity fees and unexpected power cuts across Europe? Our 15/16/30/32/36Ah lithium batteries are fully EU certified, perfect for home energy storage. Use off-peak grid power or solar energy for storage to…","card":1,"cta":"Learn More","placements":["facebook","instagram","audience_network"],"runDates":["2026-06-15","2026-06-15"],"metrics":{"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":{"bucket":"AVERAGE","conf":0.958},"why":"Names both halves of the tension (high bills and blackouts) and answers with EU certification and off-peak storage; confident AVERAGE clickability prediction. Ran in June, before the study window.","why_zh":"同时点出痛点的两面（高电费和停电），再用欧盟认证和低谷储电来回应；点击率预测为 AVERAGE 且达到置信门槛。投放于 6 月，早于研究窗口。"},{"postId":682720400,"src":"paid","net":"facebook","date":"2026-06-10","img":"ea682720400","text":"Tired of Unstable Grid? Reliable Large Capacity Battery for Your Family — Grid voltage fluctuation and unstable power supply trouble many European families? Our 15 to 36Ah large capacity lithium batteries solve this problem perfectly. All products pass strict EU safety certifications, with long…","card":2,"cta":"Learn More","placements":["facebook","instagram","audience_network"],"runDates":["2026-06-10","2026-06-15"],"metrics":{"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Speaks directly to grid instability for European families with a Learn More button; this card's clickability prediction did not reach the confidence gate.","why_zh":"直接对欧洲家庭讲电网不稳的问题，配“了解更多”按钮；这张卡片的点击率预测没有达到置信门槛。"},{"postId":682715312,"src":"organic","net":"facebook","date":"2026-08-04","img":"e682715312","text":"Perfect energy storage core for large villas, rural self-built homes and small off-grid solar power stations. 5kWh high-capacity LiFePO4 stacked battery with 4000+ deep charge cycles, excellent thermal safety, long service life. Neat indoor cabinet layout, tidy wiring, high integration for…","metrics":{"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Feature explanation (5kWh LiFePO4, 4000+ cycles, thermal safety) under a \"Blackouts happen when you least expect it\" storm visual; no engagement recorded and no confident score.","why_zh":"在“停电总在你最没准备的时候发生”的暴风雨画面下讲产品功能（5kWh 磷酸铁锂、4000+ 次循环、热安全）；没有记录到互动，也没有达到置信门槛的评分。"}],"bofu":[{"postId":682940819,"src":"organic","net":"facebook","date":"2026-09-17","img":"e682940819","text":"Three 16 kWh home energy storage batteries are being shipped, with a large stock available, priced at $12XX USD.","metrics":{"likes":1,"comments":0,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":{"bucket":"AVERAGE","conf":0.922},"why":"The only organic post that states a price and available stock, a direct conversion signal; confident AVERAGE clickability prediction and 1 like.","why_zh":"唯一一篇写明价格和现货的自然帖，是直接的转化信号；点击率预测为 AVERAGE 且达到置信门槛，1 个赞。"},{"postId":682720398,"src":"paid","net":"facebook","date":"2026-05-08","img":"ea682720398","text":"Tired of lead-acid batteries dying young (gotta replace ’em every few years!), needing constant upkeep, or taking up your whole garage? 😩 Ain’t got time for that hassle or wasting cash? Meet the JS 51.2V Home LiFePO4 Battery Lineup: Your plug-and-play power fix, built for every home! ✅ Built to…","card":1,"cta":"Call Now","placements":["facebook","instagram"],"runDates":["2026-05-08","2026-05-11"],"metrics":{"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Lead-acid replacement pitch that promises lower power bills, with a Call Now button; the cover card's clickability prediction did not reach the confidence gate.","why_zh":"以替换铅酸电池为卖点、承诺降低电费，配“立即致电”按钮；封面卡片的点击率预测没有达到置信门槛。"}]},"propositions":[{"id":5262,"type":"usp","title":"Empower your home and community with our JS Battery—stability starts at your doorstep!","text":"JS Battery's scalable energy storage ensures your home remains powered, fostering connection even when the grid fails. Tagline: \"Together, we can power through anything—one home at a time!\"","focus":"Plug-and-play scalable system sized from single backup unit to whole-home off-grid power","itemId":22354,"productId":1403,"storyId":3716,"created":false},{"id":5261,"type":"rtb","title":"Harness the power of community to safeguard your comfort and stability.","text":"With JS Battery's 10-year warranty and 6000+ deep cycles, your home can remain a hub of safety during power outages. Tagline: \"Empower your home, embrace your community.\"","focus":"6000+ deep charge cycles with a 10-year warranty, far outlasting lead-acid","itemId":22349,"productId":1403,"storyId":3716,"created":false},{"id":5260,"type":"product_features","title":"Empower Your Community: Keep the Heartbeat Alive During Turbulent Times","text":"JS Battery can keep essential appliances running during outages, ensuring community connections are never lost. Tagline: \"Energy for Every Heartbeat, Together.\"","focus":"51.2V 100Ah/314Ah/628Ah LiFePO4 configurations plus 5-8kW hybrid inverters","itemId":22344,"productId":1403,"storyId":3716,"created":false}]},{"id":"p2","name":"Portable off-grid freedom","name_zh":"便携离网自由","verdict":"owned","headline":"True freedom often lies just beyond the discomfort of change.","headline_zh":"真正的自由，往往就在改变带来的不适之后。","territory":"Reliable power for camping, van life, outdoor parties and remote work, where habits (small power banks, gas generators) slow the switch. Jingshi gave 29% of its organic posts to this territory, all in late July; Ecoflow dominates reach (59 posts, 17.9k engagements).","territory_zh":"露营、房车、户外聚会和远程办公时的可靠供电，而旧习惯（小充电宝、燃油发电机）让人迟迟不换。Jingshi 把 29% 的自然帖放在这个话题，全部集中在 7 月下旬；声量和互动由 Ecoflow 主导（59 篇，互动 1.79 万）。","persona":{"themeId":79444,"title":"The Freedom-Seeking Adventure Innovator","characterId":2862,"characterName":"Zara Windrider","summary":"Passionate about technology, camping and adventure; seeks independence, meaningful experiences and life balance, grounded in a strong need for autonomy, comfort and security.","created":false},"tension":{"themeId":79451,"type":"pain_points","title":"Empowering Freedom: The Need for Reliable Portable Power Solutions","summary":"Unreliable power in remote or off-grid settings: no portable power for essential devices while camping, travelling, working remotely or during home outages, and growing demand for accessible solutions.","brandThemeId":79432,"brandThemeTitle":"Power Solutions for Modern Needs: Addressing Portable Energy Challenges"},"angle":{"id":23693,"type":"behavioural_economic","title":"Status Quo Bias","text":"Status Quo Bias: even when current power sources are unreliable, people hesitate to switch to new portable power solutions because the change itself feels uncomfortable.","created":false},"story":{"id":3717,"title":"Charge of the Wild","narrative":"Camping by a lake, tech-loving adventurer Zara Windrider watches her phone die; unreliable batteries have cost her photos before. She hesitates to trust a new portable solar charger, then tries it: it works, and the trip turns creative. Under the stars she realises the real barrier was her own reluctance to change.","created":false},"kpi":{"evidencePosts":81,"engagement":18037,"brandPosts":10,"brandEng":9},"sov":{"brandShare":29.4,"categoryShare":6.6,"brandPosts":10,"brandTotal":34,"catPosts":71,"catTotal":1070},"trend":{"months":["2026-07","2026-08","2026-09","2026-10"],"brand":[10,0,0,0],"category":[11,24,30,6]},"trendNote":"Monthly organic post counts from posts-aggregate on the tension cluster (competitors) plus the matched Jingshi cohort-A cluster (brand); July covers 17–31 and October 1–15 only (study window 2026-07-17..2026-10-15). Category volume rose from July to September while Jingshi stopped posting in this territory after July.","examples":{"tofu":[{"postId":682715320,"src":"organic","net":"facebook","date":"2026-07-29","img":"e682715320","text":"Van life & RV travel must-have! 1kWh large capacity + 500W inverter, charge laptops, mini AC, water pump anytime anywhere. Compact portable design saves precious caravan space. 标签：#VanLifeEssentials #RVPower #RoadTripGear","metrics":{"likes":3,"comments":0,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":{"bucket":"ABOVE_AVERAGE","conf":0.854},"why":"Lifestyle-first van-life framing with no call to action; the brand's most-liked portable post (3 likes) with a confident ABOVE_AVERAGE clickability prediction.","why_zh":"以房车生活方式为先、没有行动号召；这是品牌点赞最多的便携储能帖（3 个赞），点击率预测为 ABOVE_AVERAGE 且达到置信门槛。"},{"postId":682720408,"src":"organic","net":"instagram","date":"2026-07-30","img":"e682720408","text":"Host outdoor backyard parties, beach gatherings and outdoor barbecues freely! 3kWh large capacity + 3.6kW high power supply speakers, cooling fans, electric grills and lighting system. Quiet operation without noisy generator exhaust fumes.#OutdoorPartyPower #BackyardEntertainment #BeachTripGear","metrics":{"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":null,"views":96},"score":null,"why":"Outdoor-party use case under a \"Need Massive Portable Power Anywhere?\" hook; 96 views and no confident score.","why_zh":"户外派对场景，配“随时随地需要大功率便携电源？”的钩子；96 次观看，没有达到置信门槛的评分。"},{"postId":682715324,"src":"organic","net":"facebook","date":"2026-07-28","img":"e682715324","text":"Power your entire camping trip with this 1kWh portable power station! 500W continuous inverter runs your fridge, coffee maker, lights & phone all weekend. Zero gas, quiet, lightweight for off-grid outdoor adventures. 标签：#CampingPower #PortableGenerator #OffGridLiving","metrics":{"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Camping-weekend scene opening on \"Tired of heavy bulky generators?\", the status-quo habit the angle targets; no engagement recorded and no confident score.","why_zh":"周末露营场景，以“受够了笨重的发电机？”开场，正是这个角度要打破的旧习惯；没有记录到互动，也没有达到置信门槛的评分。"}],"mofu":[{"postId":682720407,"src":"organic","net":"instagram","date":"2026-07-31","img":"e682720407","text":"Tired of small power banks that can’t run high-load devices? Our 3.6kW 3kWh portable power station easily loads air conditioners, heaters, electric ovens and water heaters. 4000+ long cycle life, IP21 protection, full safety guard.#HighPowerPortablePower #HeavyLoadPowerStation #PureSineWaveInverter","metrics":{"likes":1,"comments":0,"shares":null,"views":115},"score":null,"why":"Comparison with small power banks plus load and safety specs, the evidence a hesitant switcher needs; 115 views and 1 like, no confident score.","why_zh":"与小充电宝对比，并给出负载和安全参数，正是犹豫者换用所需的证据；115 次观看、1 个赞，没有达到置信门槛的评分。"},{"postId":682720409,"src":"organic","net":"instagram","date":"2026-07-28","img":"e682720409","text":"500w+1000kwh Portable all-in-one machine","metrics":{"likes":1,"comments":0,"shares":null,"views":123},"score":null,"why":"Spec-led reel from the same camping shoot that contrasts the unit with heavy, bulky generators on screen; 123 views and 1 like, no confident score.","why_zh":"同一组露营素材的参数向短视频，画面上与笨重发电机做对比；123 次观看、1 个赞，没有达到置信门槛的评分。"},{"postId":null,"src":"concept","net":null,"date":null,"img":"gen_camp","text":"Concept render (SOMIN-generated, not published): two friends at a lakeside campsite at sunset, a portable power station running string lights, a laptop and a mini fridge.","metrics":{"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Shows what the unit actually runs at camp, the kind of proof the story says Zara needed; a concept, so it has no metrics or score.","why_zh":"展示电源在营地实际能带动什么，正是故事里 Zara 需要的证明；这是概念图，没有数据，也没有评分。"}],"bofu":[]},"propositions":[{"id":5265,"type":"usp","title":"Your Power, Your Terms.","text":"Our plug-and-play system allows me to customize my energy experience, from home to off-grid. Tagline: \"Choose freedom; power your life your way.\"","focus":"Plug-and-play scalable system sized from single backup unit to whole-home off-grid power","itemId":22370,"productId":1403,"storyId":3717,"created":false},{"id":5264,"type":"rtb","title":"From discomfort to reliability, reclaim your power with JS Battery.","text":"With advanced technology and efficiency, our batteries promise power that lasts for years. Tagline: \"Power your path to freedom.\"","focus":"6000+ deep charge cycles with a 10-year warranty, far outlasting lead-acid","itemId":22366,"productId":1403,"storyId":3717,"created":false},{"id":5263,"type":"product_features","title":"Transform Limitations into New Horizons","text":"With scalable configurations and hybrid inverters, JS Battery empowers me to adapt my energy needs on-the-go. Tagline: \"Unlock new possibilities with JS Battery - Your adventure starts with reliable power.\"","focus":"51.2V 100Ah/314Ah/628Ah LiFePO4 configurations plus 5-8kW hybrid inverters","itemId":22361,"productId":1403,"storyId":3717,"created":false}]},{"id":"p3","name":"Installer trust & support","name_zh":"安装商信任与售后","verdict":"whitespace","headline":"Without trust, even the sunniest days can feel dark.","headline_zh":"没有信任，再晴朗的日子也会显得黯淡。","territory":"Installers and distributors worry about skills gaps, complex systems and who supports the system after installation; Felicitysolar (64 posts) and Must Energy (42) fill this space. Jingshi had no organic posts here in the window; its closest content is May–June paid ads aimed at EU distributors.","territory_zh":"安装商和经销商担心技能缺口、系统复杂，以及安装之后由谁来提供支持；Felicitysolar（64 篇）和 Must Energy（42 篇）占据了这块话题。研究窗口内 Jingshi 没有任何相关自然帖，最接近的是 5–6 月面向欧盟经销商的付费广告。","persona":{"themeId":79439,"title":"Eco-Empowered Business Catalyst","characterId":2863,"characterName":"Damon Ecofield","summary":"Driven by renewable energy and technology, pursues business success and environmental stewardship; needs security, trust and growth and seeks reliable partnerships in clean tech.","created":false},"tension":{"themeId":79453,"type":"pain_points","title":"Challenges in the Renewable Energy Sector: Addressing Skills Gaps and Installer Support","summary":"Lack of skilled local installers, unreliable post-installation support and complex systems such as confusing inverter set-up; brands answer with installer training, incentives and local partnerships.","brandThemeId":null,"brandThemeTitle":null},"angle":{"id":23699,"type":"economic","title":"Inadequate post-installation support","text":"Transaction Cost Economics: when the perceived cost of after-sales problems is high, buyers avoid or delay solar and storage investments, so anxiety about support blocks adoption.","created":false},"story":{"id":3718,"title":"The Bright Side of Shadows","narrative":"Solar entrepreneur Damon Ecofield wins installation contracts with local businesses until café owner Carla breaks down over a faulty inverter and asks whether he will be there when things go wrong. Short of trained support staff, he partners with local training programmes to certify installers and opens transparent support channels. Clients regain confidence, and he learns the promise after the sale matters most.","created":false},"kpi":{"evidencePosts":119,"engagement":7677,"brandPosts":0,"brandEng":0},"sov":{"brandShare":0.0,"categoryShare":11.1,"brandPosts":0,"brandTotal":34,"catPosts":119,"catTotal":1070},"trend":{"months":["2026-07","2026-08","2026-09","2026-10"],"brand":[0,0,0,0],"category":[19,22,66,12]},"trendNote":"Monthly organic post counts from posts-aggregate on the tension cluster (competitors) plus the matched Jingshi cohort-A cluster (brand); July covers 17–31 and October 1–15 only (study window 2026-07-17..2026-10-15). Jingshi has no cohort-A theme for installer support, so its series is 0 by measurement (posts-aggregate on cluster 79453 returns 0 Jingshi posts). Category volume tripled in September (66).","examples":{"tofu":[{"postId":682765389,"src":"organic","net":"instagram","date":"2026-08-25","img":"e682765389","text":"(No caption. On-screen text: a 6.2kW inverter + 16kWh energy storage unit packed and ready for shipment to Italy.)","metrics":{"likes":null,"comments":0,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":{"bucket":"AVERAGE","conf":0.815},"why":"Proof-of-export brand feel with no call to action, which reassures distributors that the factory ships to Europe; confident AVERAGE clickability prediction.","why_zh":"展示出口发货的品牌氛围内容，没有行动号召，让经销商放心工厂能发往欧洲；点击率预测为 AVERAGE 且达到置信门槛。"},{"postId":682765375,"src":"organic","net":"tiktok","date":"2026-08-25","img":"e682765375","text":"8kW US‑standard inverter + 15kWh battery shipped to the United States","metrics":{"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"views":103},"score":null,"why":"Shipment clip that signals US-standard compatibility; 103 views and no confident score.","why_zh":"展示美标逆变器发货的短视频，传递符合美标的信号；103 次观看，没有达到置信门槛的评分。"},{"postId":682765376,"src":"organic","net":"tiktok","date":"2026-08-25","img":"e682765376","text":"16Kwh household energy storage lithium battery packed and ready for shipment to the Philippines.","metrics":{"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"views":94},"score":null,"why":"Completes the global-footprint set with a Philippines shipment; 94 views and no confident score.","why_zh":"菲律宾发货视频，补全“全球出货”这组内容；94 次观看，没有达到置信门槛的评分。"}],"mofu":[{"postId":682720399,"src":"paid","net":"facebook","date":"2026-06-16","img":"ea682720399","text":"Worry About Battery Safety? Full EU Certified Home Storage Battery — Safety is your top concern when picking energy storage batteries? Our 15/16/30/32/36Ah products hold complete EU certifications including CE and RoHS. Adopting high-quality cells and professional BMS system, it prevents…","card":1,"cta":"Learn More","placements":["facebook","instagram","audience_network"],"runDates":["2026-06-16","2026-06-27"],"metrics":{"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":{"bucket":"AVERAGE","conf":0.949},"why":"Credibility content (CE/RoHS certification, BMS protection) that answers \"can I trust this system?\"; confident AVERAGE clickability prediction. Ran in June, before the study window.","why_zh":"以 CE/RoHS 认证和 BMS 保护建立可信度，回答“这套系统靠不靠得住”；点击率预测为 AVERAGE 且达到置信门槛。投放于 6 月，早于研究窗口。"},{"postId":682720401,"src":"paid","net":"facebook","date":"2026-05-20","img":"ea682720401","text":"🔥EU Standard Battery｜Low After-sales, High Profit — ⚡Looking for qualified home battery suppliers? We have complete CE, UN38.3 & MSDS certificates for smooth EU customs clearance. In stock, fast delivery and OEM support, ideal for European distributors.","card":3,"cta":"Learn More","placements":["facebook","instagram","audience_network"],"runDates":["2026-05-20","2026-06-08"],"metrics":{"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":{"bucket":"AVERAGE","conf":0.816},"why":"Jingshi's only message on distributors' after-sales burden, the core of this tension (the same card also runs in ad 682720402); confident AVERAGE clickability prediction. Ran May–June, before the study window.","why_zh":"Jingshi 唯一直接回应经销商售后负担的信息，正是这个痛点的核心（同一张卡片也出现在广告 682720402 中）；点击率预测为 AVERAGE 且达到置信门槛。投放于 5–6 月，早于研究窗口。"},{"postId":null,"src":"concept","net":null,"date":null,"img":"gen_install","text":"Concept render (SOMIN-generated, not published): an installer in a hi-vis vest wires a hybrid inverter above a wall-mounted battery, solar roof visible through the window.","metrics":{"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Puts the installer, the role competitors court and Jingshi never shows, at the centre; a concept, so it has no metrics or score.","why_zh":"把安装商放在画面中心——竞品在争取、而 Jingshi 从未展示过的角色；这是概念图，没有数据，也没有评分。"}],"bofu":[{"postId":683251740,"src":"organic","net":"tiktok","date":"2026-10-08","img":"e683251740","text":"Hello everyone! Here are 10 sets of 51.2V 314Ah, 16kWh LFP battery packs ready for shipment. We are a professional lithium battery manufacturer, supporting OEM & ODM customization. DM us for inquiries and orders!","metrics":{"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"views":98},"score":{"bucket":"ABOVE_AVERAGE","conf":0.939},"why":"Direct \"DM us for inquiries and orders!\" call to action to B2B buyers with OEM/ODM support; confident ABOVE_AVERAGE clickability prediction, 98 views.","why_zh":"直接对 B2B 买家喊出“私信咨询和下单”，并支持 OEM/ODM；点击率预测为 ABOVE_AVERAGE 且达到置信门槛，98 次观看。"},{"postId":683251736,"src":"organic","net":"tiktok","date":"2026-10-09","img":"e683251736","text":"Our 16kWh home energy storage lithium battery. 4 terminal posts, support parallel expansion. 4.3-inch screen for real-time battery data. Built with brand-new Grade A 314Ah cells. 8000 cycles, service life over 10 years. OEM & ODM available. Global partners are welcome to contact us!","metrics":{"likes":2,"comments":0,"shares":0,"views":104},"score":{"bucket":"AVERAGE","conf":0.871},"why":"Spec walkthrough (Grade A 314Ah cells, 8000 cycles) that closes with an invitation for global partners to get in touch; confident AVERAGE clickability prediction, 2 likes.","why_zh":"逐项讲解参数（A 级 314Ah 电芯、8000 次循环），结尾邀请全球合作伙伴联系；点击率预测为 AVERAGE 且达到置信门槛，2 个赞。"},{"postId":683306692,"src":"organic","net":"facebook","date":"2026-10-10","img":"e683306692","text":"This is the 3.6kW+2.5kWh all-in-one energy storage inverter manufactured by our company. This product can output 230V AC voltage, with a maximum photovoltaic input of 5000 watts. The unit is equipped with two universal sockets, five USB ports and one Type-C port. Meanwhile, the device has built-in…","metrics":{"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Partner-inquiry call to action on the 3.6kW+2.5kWh all-in-one unit; no engagement recorded and no confident score.","why_zh":"针对 3.6kW+2.5kWh 一体机发出合作询盘号召；没有记录到互动，也没有达到置信门槛的评分。"}]},"propositions":[{"id":5268,"type":"usp","title":"Transform Uncertainty into Clean Energy Confidence.","text":"Our scalable energy storage solution is designed for seamless integration and consistent performance. Tagline: \"Empower Your Home, Empower Your World.\"","focus":"Plug-and-play scalable system sized from single backup unit to whole-home off-grid power","itemId":22385,"productId":1403,"storyId":3718,"created":false},{"id":5267,"type":"rtb","title":"Empower Your Future with Reliable Energy Storage.","text":"With over 6000 deep cycles and a 10-year warranty, JS Battery embodies reliability in energy storage. Tagline: \"Trust in Energy, Empower Your Life with JS Battery.\"","focus":"6000+ deep charge cycles with a 10-year warranty, far outlasting lead-acid","itemId":22379,"productId":1403,"storyId":3718,"created":false},{"id":5266,"type":"product_features","title":"Transform uncertainty into power: Count on JS Battery for seamless energy storage.","text":"From portable power to scalable home units, our solutions ensure you are always supported. Tagline: \"Power Your Confidence with JS Battery!\"","focus":"51.2V 100Ah/314Ah/628Ah LiFePO4 configurations plus 5-8kW hybrid inverters","itemId":22376,"productId":1403,"storyId":3718,"created":false}]}],"created":{"studies":[],"characters":[],"angles":[],"stories":[],"products":[],"propositions":[]},"notes":["Nothing new was created in SOMIN: the three pillars reuse stories #3716, #3717 and #3718 (characters 2861/2862/2863, angles 23687/23693/23699) and their nine propositions #5260–#5268 on product #1403, all already in the workspace.","Study pairing: the stories were built on study 10645 (competitors only, 1,107 organic posts, 2026-07-17..2026-10-15), which contains no Jingshi posts. Brand figures come from the same-window brand-only study 10644 (34 posts) via the closest theme: P1 79450↔79435, P2 79451↔79432, P3 79453↔none. posts-aggregate on the combined clusters reproduces the totals exactly (94/17,838, 81/18,037, 119/7,677).","Share-of-voice denominators: brandTotal = 34 (sum of 10644 pain-point themes), catTotal = 1,070 (sum of 10645 pain-point themes; the study holds 1,107 posts in total).","Verdict rule: whitespace = brand has 0 posts in the territory; owned = brandShare at least 2x categoryShare; contested = both active within 0.5–2x; emerging = brand present but under 0.5x. \"Owned\" and \"contested\" describe the brand's own content mix, not reach: Jingshi earned 1 and 9 engagements in P1 and P2 against 17,837 and 18,028 for competitors.","Clickability is stored per image. Each example uses the score of the exact image shown. The five paid examples are dynamic-creative/carousel ads; each shows one card (that card's title, copy, CTA and image): 682720403 card 1, 682720400 card 2, 682720398 card 1, 682720399 card 1, 682720401 card 3. Score gate: 8 of 20 real examples pass (confidence > 0.80); the other 12 carry score = null.","All six Jingshi Meta ads ran 2026-05-08..2026-06-27, before the study window, and the Ads Library returns no engagement for them (metrics null). Ads 682720399, 682720400 and 682720403 rotate the same five card variants.","P3 has no Jingshi posts clustered in the installer-support tension, so its examples are matched by content (distributor, certification and export-proof posts) rather than by cluster.","Funnel rule used: price, \"DM us for inquiries and orders\" and partner-contact invitations = BOFU; problem/solution or certification copy with a Learn More button = MOFU; lifestyle posts and one-line shipment montages with no CTA = TOFU.","P2 BOFU is empty: Jingshi has no portable-power post with a price or conversion CTA, so none was invented. P1 BOFU has two real posts only.","Three concept renders (gen_xhs, gen_camp, gen_install) are earlier SOMIN-generated planning images, not published posts; they carry no metrics or scores. At most one concept per pillar.","682720406 (Instagram) and 682715313 (Facebook) share the same caption; 682720409 and 682715324 come from the same camping video shoot.","Data quirks: posts-search with clusterIds silently applies a default date range unless startDate/endDate are given, and paging with sortBy=total_engagement repeats posts when engagement ties at 0 (5 missing posts were fetched by contentIds)."]},{"e682720406":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682715313":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","gen_xhs":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","ea682720403":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","ea682720400":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682715312":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682940819":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","ea682720398":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682715320":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682720408":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682715324":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682720407":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682720409":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","gen_camp":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682765389":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682765375":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682765376":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","ea682720399":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","ea682720401":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","gen_install":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e683251740":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e683251736":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e683306692":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"});
